  "source_extraction_and_validation": [
    "First four trajectories read from hash-verified already-published native CSVs.",
    "Fifth optimizer statistics bound to complete native audit by identical8-rank log hashes before and after checkpoint650/evaluation.",
    "Fifth text points extracted from original native accepted-training text_metrics.json aggregates, each matched against the50 hashes in the complete native audit; no detector recomputation.",
    "Exact5x200 update coordinates and5x50 round coordinates,8-rank flags,512 responses per round and token totals were checked.",
    "Each round q-NLL reconstructed from the four token-weighted native update values; mean length independently equals validtokens/512.",
    "The public long CSV preserves all original preview CSV bytes; standalone renderer checks all3000 coordinates, no duplicates/missing points and denominator labels."
  ],
  "excluded_populations": [
    "all-completed rollout candidates",
    "private BBB offline candidate assessments",
    "primary or secondary evaluation responses"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "One online training trajectory per method; no multi-seed replication or inference of causal relationships from aligned curves.",
    "Repetition and garble candidates are different nonexclusive mechanical detectors.",
    "Conditional mismatch d is distinct from NLL/log-PPL; neither is a parameter-gradient decomposition.",
    "This supplement does not complete the missing methods, canonical candidate comparison or secondary endpoints."
  ],
